{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966400/extras/617ac307171bf9db66c4d762cfebd6a1.poster.avif?t=1756217452\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966400/extras/617ac307171bf9db66c4d762cfebd6a1.webm?t=1756217452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966400/extras/617ac307171bf9db66c4d762cfebd6a1.mp4?t=1756217452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Den-Den: Tokyo Horror is a survival horror experience where you play as a caregiver for the elderly. In this prologue to the full game, you'll experience the night before the events of the game take place. Navigate through the dark mind of Kana as you find a way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive the nightmare before it consumes you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and navigate through the dark mind of Kana as you find a way to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for limited resources wherever and however you deem necessary for the survival of yourself and those you care for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself and survive using a variety of tools and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the violent monsters lurking in the dark corners of Kana's mind.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966400?t=1756217452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966400/61f211bb36bf6021be42bb42dca8aa507516f011/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756217452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s